#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:5
#: e6796e7499344be4862e1f833f5715c3
msgid "Servo Gripper"
msgstr "舵机夹爪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:7
#: cca8a36514a44582a89a4d66d955d861
msgid ""
"This article explains how to connect a servo to an autopilot and configure "
"it for use as a gripper which is useful for delivery or bottle drop "
"applications. The servo can be controlled directly by the pilot via a switch"
" on the transmitter or as part of a mission.  You may wish to refer to the "
":ref:`general servo wiki page <common-servo>` for other ways servos can be "
"controlled."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何将舵机连接到飞控并配置为夹爪（用于投递或瓶子投放应用）。舵机可由飞手通过遥控器开关直接控制，也可作为任务的一部分。您可参阅 "
":ref:`通用舵机文档页面 <common-servo>` 了解舵机的其他控制方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:14
#: 76f70537c2e74419ab5ae187888436da
msgid "Connecting the servo to an autopilot"
msgstr "将舵机连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:19
#: 1fbcf1c2f6fb41dcb5f7ac081c045e14
msgid ""
"If using Copter, connect the servo to AUX OUT 1, 2, 3 or 4 if the autopilot "
"includes an IOMCU for the first 8 MAIN outputs, or any output operating at "
"50Hz if the autopilot does not use an IOMCU.  MAIN OUT 1 ~ 8 should be "
"avoided because these normally update at 400hz.  If using Plane or Rover "
"where all PWM output pins usually update at 50hz, any unused output may be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Copter，若飞控具有用于前 8 个主输出的 IOMCU，请将舵机连接到 AUX OUT 1、2、3 或 4；若飞控不使用 "
"IOMCU，则连接到任何以 50 Hz 工作的输出。应避免使用 MAIN OUT 1～8，因为这些通常以 400 Hz 更新。如果使用 Plane 或 "
"Rover（所有 PWM 输出引脚通常以 50 Hz 更新），则可使用任何未用的输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:20
#: 09cbf995467f44ffa145caa76db18a8c
msgid ""
"In some autopilots with IOMCUs, AUX OUT 5 and 6 cannot be used by default "
"because they are setup by default as :ref:`Relays <common-relay>`.  These "
"pins can changed to Servo outputs by setting the ``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` parameter"
" to 6 and setting :ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` and "
":ref:`RELAY1_PIN<RELAY1_PIN>` to -1."
msgstr ""
"在某些具有 IOMCU 的飞控上，AUX OUT 5 和 6 默认不可用，因为它们被配置为 :ref:`继电器 <common-relay>`。可通过将"
" ``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` 参数设置为 6，并将 :ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` 和 "
":ref:`RELAY1_PIN<RELAY1_PIN>` 设置为 -1，将这些引脚更改为舵机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:21
#: 2fa1067dcdde45b6ad876f8ebdfd43e4
msgid ""
"If the autopilot cannot provide power to the servos, an external BEC or ESC "
"that can provide 5V should be used."
msgstr "如果飞控无法为舵机供电，应使用能提供 5V 的外部 BEC 或 ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:24
#: b2971933a3774fbca4c5942ff60ae24a
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:25
#: 34c3ee82cc11458e8001d03accf31460
msgid ""
"set which RC output is used by setting SERVOx_FUNCTION (or RCX_FUNCTION) to "
"28 (i.e. if using AUX OUT 1 on a Pixhawk, set :ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION "
"<SERVO9_FUNCTION>` to 28)."
msgstr ""
"将 SERVOx_FUNCTION（或 RCX_FUNCTION）设置为 28 来指定使用哪个 RC 输出（例如，若在 Pixhawk 上使用 AUX "
"OUT 1，则将 :ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` 设置为 28）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:26
#: 8ade0a1ee1ac4338b4a0420138af6763
msgid ""
":ref:`GRIP_ENABLE <GRIP_ENABLE>` to 1 to enable the gripper feature and then"
" refetch parameters from the ground station in order to make other gripper "
"parameters visible."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GRIP_ENABLE <GRIP_ENABLE>` 设置为 1 以启用夹爪功能，然后从地面站重新获取参数，以使其他夹爪参数可见。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:27
#: a7f8ab72653c4fd8a5e80d89b26058dc
msgid ""
":ref:`GRIP_TYPE <GRIP_TYPE>` to 1 to enable the servo gripper and reboot the"
" autopilot"
msgstr ":ref:`GRIP_TYPE <GRIP_TYPE>` 设置为 1 以启用舵机夹爪，然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:28
#: 762b50fc85cc448d862adac7d3f766e2
msgid ""
":ref:`GRIP_GRAB <GRIP_GRAB>` to the pwm value (i.e. 1000 ~ 2000) for the "
"gripper's closed position"
msgstr ":ref:`GRIP_GRAB <GRIP_GRAB>` 设置为夹爪关闭位置的 PWM 值（如 1000～2000）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:29
#: 83ae2c60864c41b5a5b4c816167496b2
msgid ""
":ref:`GRIP_RELEASE <GRIP_RELEASE>` to the pwm value for the gripper's open "
"position"
msgstr ":ref:`GRIP_RELEASE <GRIP_RELEASE>` 设置为夹爪打开位置的 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:30
#: b1a9a99eaf9c44f3bb18b8a1bc31a6ce
msgid ""
":ref:`GRIP_NEUTRAL <GRIP_NEUTRAL>` to the pwm value for the gripper's "
"neutral position (often the same as its closed position)"
msgstr ":ref:`GRIP_NEUTRAL <GRIP_NEUTRAL>` 设置为夹爪中立位置的 PWM 值（通常与关闭位置相同）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:33
#: f31cddf191c84632af97b0bd6cf9ac7d
msgid "Controlling Gripper from the transmitter"
msgstr "通过遥控器控制抓手"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:35
#: 5e052576b2db4cb8afed6d86a7a3da98
msgid ""
"One of the transmitter's auxiliary switches can control the gripper by "
"setting an ``RCx_OPTION`` parameter to \"19\" (Gripper)."
msgstr "可将遥控器的某个辅助开关设置为 ``RCx_OPTION`` 参数值 「19」（Gripper），从而控制抓手。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:38
#: 7e220f7c284949af894411b15c7f9fe9
msgid "Controlling Gripper during a mission"
msgstr "在任务执行期间控制抓手"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:40
#: 111702b651c9451092f669f3c92cc791
msgid ""
"The gripper position can be controlled during a mission in AUTO mode using "
"the :ref:`DO_GRIPPER <common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd>` "
"command.  Set the \"drop/grab\" column to 0 to drop (open the gripper), 1 to"
" grab (close the gripper)."
msgstr ""
"在 Auto 模式的任务执行期间，可使用 :ref:`DO_GRIPPER <common-mavlink-mission-command-"
"messages-mav_cmd>` 命令控制抓手位置。将 「drop/grab」 列设为 0 表示释放（打开抓手），设为 1 表示抓取（关闭抓手）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:46
#: 55996bed0cd64307b3316e65003eacf5
msgid "Controlling Gripper from the ground station"
msgstr "通过地面站控制抓手"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-servo.rst:48
#: 34b79a2017704ecea612f1c53dfe5462
msgid ""
"The gripper can be opened or closed in real-time from the ground station if "
"the ground station sends a `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ with the "
"command field set to DO_GRIPPER (i.e. 211) but there are no ground stations "
"(as far as we know) that support doing this."
msgstr ""
"如果地面站发送 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ 消息并将 command "
"字段设置为 DO_GRIPPER（即 211），则可以实时打开或关闭抓手，但据我们所知，目前没有地面站支持此操作。"
